    - key: 204
      value:
        matchups: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5660b95ce5f607a4884370642690984d, type: 2}
        description: 2,600 hull; 1,400 shields; speed 48. Four light long-range 2-burst
          turbolasers and four 2-burst laser cannons. Weapons, engines and shields
          cannot be targeted separately. No hangar or fighter complement. Boost Weapon
          Power doubles fire rate for 20 s, stops shield regeneration, reduces speed
          to 25% and increases incoming damage by 50%.
        role: Artillery / Light Cruiser
        iconKey: e54026c071416a845b2d23e814c1e8d5:21300000
        isHero: 0
