        matchups: {fileID: 11400000, guid: da45b1d1432550f47a485d67cb1fb21f, type: 2}
        description: 600 hull; 800 shields; speed 35. Four 2-burst laser cannons,
          two dual repeating point-defense mounts, two heavy 2-burst ion blasters
